"==============================================================================\n"
"Egypt Accounting Basic Charts and Localization.\n"
"\n"
"Activates:\n"
"\n"
"- Chart of Accounts\n"
"- Taxes\n"
"- VAT Return\n"
"- Withholding Tax Report\n"
